Father Marone is a broad man, five foot four and some 350 pounds, with a monkey's face, big round ears, and golden fur on his arms. He wears a white suit with no shirt beneath it and the jacket hanging open, and he is hung with gold: at least one ring on every finger, heavy chains at his neck, earrings. He wears dark sunglasses indoors and smokes cigars.

He is the concierge of the [[Org/Velvet Mark/index|Velvet Mark]]. He receives visitors in a penthouse on the twenty-seventh floor of a tower in the [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Masque District/index|Masque District]]. He has set the party against [[Org/Pyrelight/People/The Spark|the Spark]].
